<title>CANADA: Toronto stocks weaken at open as golds tumble.</title>
<headline>Toronto stocks weaken at open as golds tumble.</headline>
<text>
<p>CHANGE				     CHANGE</p>
<p>TSE	 6448.82    -4.83   HI 6448.82	     LO  6448.82</p>
<p>DJI	 7715.09   +60.84   GOLD (LONDON)   US$337.30  +0.35</p>
<p>FTSE	4625.80   -32.10   GOLD (NY-SPOT)  US$338.00  -1.80</p>
<p>NIKKEI   20523.75  -101.01   LME CASH NICKEL US$6950   -15.00</p>
<p>CANDLR     1.3810		LME CASH ALUM   US$1556.5   -0.5</p>
<p>CAN 30-YR  115.17    +0.20   BRENT CRUDE     US$18.13   +0.28</p>
<p>--------------------MARKET COMMENT----------------------------</p>
<p>* Toronto stocks moved lower at the open on Friday as the gold sector tumbled more than one percent. * Trading was very heavy as 23.1 million shares traded worth C$646 million.</p>
